## Project information
* 2-D pitting model for propagation stage of single and multiple pits. The model is based on the set of mass transport of charged ions in electrolyte with the moving boundary tracked by the phase field method under galvanostatic conditions. 
* Model is solved using the commercial FEA code from Comsol Multiphysics. Simulated electrochemical data is processed using the python code and visualized in Matlab. 
* Documents and example script for Comsol Livelink with Matlab are provided for references.

External Comsol Files for Single Pit Growth and Multi Pits Growth: https://www.dropbox.com/sh/b4jcgw6fe0p2937/AAB22UvhNYBiD-e7IHGHg-qpa?dl=0

